multidoc examples
=================

Run the Scheme programs with csi -s from this directory, after
installing multidoc with chicken-install.

  guide.sxml        A sample page in the svnwiki SXML vocabulary:
                    sections, labels and references, definitions,
                    examples, a table with spans, lists and code.
  Stacks.sxml       A second page, which links to guide.sxml.

  convert.scm       Converts guide.sxml with every registered writer,
                    and shows render and layout->string.
  build-ir.scm      Builds a document with the IR constructors, and
                    transforms it with filters and queries.
  styled-table.scm  A table with header and footer parts, spanning
                    cells and styles, in plain text, Markdown, HTML
                    and LaTeX.
  extend.scm        New SXML elements read as custom nodes, node
                    writers for HTML and Texinfo, a derived writer
                    and a new writer.
  cli.sh            The multidoc program: formats, writer options,
                    divisions, standard input, and a site of two
                    pages whose links are checked and resolved.
                    Writes its results to out/.
